WEBVTT

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:31.236
and to never come out.

00:07:31.236 --> 00:07:33.396
So I do want to be really clear,

00:07:33.396 --> 00:07:35.756
this is not an argument for depression.

00:07:35.796 --> 00:07:37.036
And --

00:07:37.076 --> 00:07:38.356
(Laughter)

00:07:38.356 --> 00:07:40.476
If that's what you think
you're experiencing,

00:07:40.476 --> 00:07:42.996
please, please do go seek help.

00:07:43.036 --> 00:07:46.516
I'm talking about a different
state of mind that we all live in,

00:07:46.556 --> 00:07:48.996
where the light and the dark
move together.

00:07:49.036 --> 00:07:50.876
And I am saying that right now,

00:07:50.916 --> 00:07:53.556
our culture is afraid of the dark.

00:07:53.596 --> 00:07:55.676
And that all this normative sunshine

00:07:55.716 --> 00:07:59.036
can distract you
from your rightful heritage.

00:07:59.076 --> 00:08:00.676
In Homer's "Odyssey,"